# curation review artifacts (regenerated each image wave)
/contact-sheets/
# recrop-wide-images.mjs working directory: 2400px originals re-downloaded
# from Commons plus the crop candidates and review sheets. ~13 MB a wave,
# and every byte of it is reproducible with --fetch --candidates.
/recrop-work/

# generated tracking reports — regenerate locally with `npm run docs:refresh`.
# Not in git because they are derived from data/cars.json (so they would churn
# on every wave and conflict on every merge) and they are read in a local
# markdown preview, not on GitHub. The hand-written docs/ files stay tracked:
# they record decisions, and CLAUDE.md links to them.
/CATALOG.md
/docs/PHOTO-CHECK.md
/docs/IMAGES-WANTED.md
